{"seq":2,"slug":"universal-gravitation","title":"万有引力定律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/core-contributions/classical-mechanics/universal-gravitation","wordCount":1869,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"万有引力定律\">万有引力定律</h1><p>让牛顿真正名垂青史的，不是三大运动定律本身，而是他把这些定律与一条全新的力联系起来——万有引力。这条定律断言：宇宙间任意两个有质量的物体，都以一种普遍的方式相互吸引。正是它把地面上苹果的坠落、月球绕地球的运行和行星绕太阳的公转，统一为同一种物理现象。这是科学史上&quot;统一&quot;的第一个伟大范例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>万有引力定律的内容可以浓缩为一个公式：任意两质点间的引力，正比于它们质量的乘积，反比于它们距离的平方，方向沿二者连线。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = G\\,\\frac{m_1 m_2}{r^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是引力常量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两物体的质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是它们之间的距离。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;开普勒三定律 · 经验观测&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;平方反比假设&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;第二定律 F = ma&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    D[&quot;向心加速度 a = v²/r&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;万有引力定律 F = G m₁m₂/r²&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;推导出椭圆轨道&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;解释月地运动统一&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;预言潮汐 · 岁差 · 彗星&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"开普勒三定律 · 经验观测\"] --&gt; B[\"平方反比假设\"]\n    C[\"第二定律 F = ma\"] --&gt; B\n    D[\"向心加速度 a = v²/r\"] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E[\"万有引力定律 F = G m₁m₂/r²\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"推导出椭圆轨道\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"解释月地运动统一\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"预言潮汐 · 岁差 · 彗星\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普遍性</td>\n<td>&quot;万有&quot;——所有有质量的物体都参与</td>\n<td>颠覆&quot;天上&quot;与&quot;人间&quot;二分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平方反比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>∝</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\propto 1/r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与球面几何扩散一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量乘积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F\\propto m_1 m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>引力质量与惯性质量等价（后由广义相对论深化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力常量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>6.674</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G\\approx 6.674\\times10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{N\\cdot m^2/kg^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.674</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>牛顿本人未测出，1798 年卡文迪许实验首次测定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"苹果的传说与真实\">苹果的传说与真实</h2><p>&quot;牛顿被落下的苹果砸到头而悟出引力&quot;是流传最广的科学轶事，但它的真实成分需要厘清。可靠的史料来自牛顿晚年的友人威廉·斯蒂克利（William Stukeley）1726 年的回忆录，以及伏尔泰的转述：牛顿确曾向人讲述，1665—1666 年因伦敦大瘟疫而避居乡间伍尔索普庄园时，看到一颗苹果坠落，由此联想到——使苹果坠地的力，是否也延伸到月球那么远？</p>\n<p>但&quot;砸到头&quot;是后世的夸张演绎，斯蒂克利的原文只说牛顿&quot;坐在花园里沉思&quot;时看到苹果落下。更重要的是，苹果至多提供了灵感的火花；从灵感到严密的平方反比定律，牛顿花了近二十年，期间需要发展微积分、证明球壳定理等大量数学工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平方反比律的来历\">平方反比律的来历</h2><p>平方反比的想法在牛顿之前已在空气中酝酿。罗伯特·胡克在 1670 年代的通信中就猜测引力可能按距离平方反比衰减，并曾就此与牛顿通信——这后来成为二人交恶、以及优先权争议的源头之一。但胡克只有定性猜测，无法用它推导出开普勒的椭圆轨道。</p>\n<p>牛顿的决定性贡献在于：他证明了若引力遵循平方反比律，则行星的轨道必然是以太阳为焦点之一的椭圆，从而严格地导出了开普勒第一定律；同时也能导出面积速度恒定（第二定律）与周期—半径关系（第三定律）。这一证明正是 1684 年哈雷登门求教时牛顿已掌握、并写入小册子《论运动》（<em>De Motu</em>）的核心成果，它直接催生了《原理》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"球壳定理与月地检验\">球壳定理与月地检验</h2><p>把&quot;万有引力&quot;应用到地球这样的庞大球体时，会遇到一个棘手问题：地面上的人离地心约 6400 公里，到底该用哪个距离代入公式？牛顿用微积分证明了著名的&quot;球壳定理&quot;：一个质量均匀分布的球壳，对其外部物体的引力，等效于把全部质量集中在球心。这一定理使得&quot;距离&quot;可以干净地取为到地心的距离，整个计算才得以自洽。</p>\n<p>有了它，牛顿做了著名的&quot;月地检验&quot;：地面重力加速度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.8\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，月球轨道半径约为地球半径的 60 倍。若引力按平方反比衰减，月球处的加速度应约为地面的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>60</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/60^2\\approx1/3600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3600</span></span></span></span></span>。把这个数值与月球实际的向心加速度（由其轨道周期和半径算出）相比较，二者吻合得相当好。正是这一吻合，让牛顿确信&quot;苹果之力&quot;与&quot;维系月球之力&quot;是同一种力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-超距-诘难到惯性质量\">从&quot;超距&quot;诘难到惯性质量</h2><p>万有引力最令人不安之处，是它假定两个天各一方的物体竟能&quot;隔着虚空&quot;彼此施力，且不需要任何介质或时间——这就是所谓&quot;超距作用&quot;。这是当时最锋利的反对意见：笛卡尔派坚持力必须经由接触或涡旋传递，惠更斯、莱布尼茨都据此拒绝接受引力。</p>\n<p>牛顿自己的态度颇耐人寻味：他在《原理》的&quot;总释&quot;中明确写下，他并不&quot;杜撰假说&quot;（Hypotheses non fingo）去解释引力的成因，只陈述它&quot;确实存在、且按平方反比作用&quot;。他把引力如何起作用的问题悬置，只回答它起什么作用——这种克制正是牛顿方法论的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质疑</th>\n<th>反对者的理由</th>\n<th>牛顿的回应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>力怎可&quot;超距&quot;作用？</td>\n<td>必须有介质/接触才能传力</td>\n<td>不下断言，只描述其数学规律</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力是否即时传递？</td>\n<td>作用与反作用应同时同地</td>\n<td>悬置成因，留待后人（相对论作答）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力质量是谁？</td>\n<td>凭什么用质量作为引力来源</td>\n<td>引力质量与惯性质量同值，物理事实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得一提的是，牛顿区分了不加证明的&quot;假说&quot;与从现象归纳出的&quot;推论&quot;，并把后者视为可接受的科学内容。超距作用之谜要等到 1915 年广义相对论，才被&quot;质量弯曲时空、引力是时空几何的效应&quot;这一图景取代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用范围与历史地位\">适用范围与历史地位</h2><p>万有引力定律在绝大多数情形下精确得惊人：它预言了潮汐、地球的扁率、岁差、彗星的回归，1846 年更据其计算成功预言了海王星的存在。但它也有可观测的偏差——水星近日点的进动有一小部分无法用牛顿引力解释，这一谜题最终由爱因斯坦 1915 年的广义相对论破解。</p>\n<p>因此，万有引力定律不是引力的&quot;终极理论&quot;，而是广义相对论在弱场、低速极限下的极佳近似。但它的历史地位无可撼动：它第一次用一条数学定律统一了天与地，示范了&quot;用普遍定律解释多样现象&quot;的科学纲领，深刻影响了此后三百年的物理学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>万有引力定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=Gm_1m_2/r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 断言所有有质量物体普遍相互吸引，统一了天体与地面现象。</li>\n<li>苹果传说有可靠史料根据（斯蒂克利回忆录），但&quot;砸头&quot;为后世夸张；从灵感到定律历时近二十年。</li>\n<li>平方反比的猜测胡克等人已有，牛顿的关键贡献是据此严格导出开普勒椭圆轨道。</li>\n<li>球壳定理使&quot;距离取到地心&quot;得以自洽，月地检验证实了引力的统一性。</li>\n<li>该定律是广义相对论的弱场近似，水星进动等偏差最终由相对论解释。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"万有引力定律","id":"万有引力定律"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"苹果的传说与真实","id":"苹果的传说与真实"},{"level":2,"text":"平方反比律的来历","id":"平方反比律的来历"},{"level":2,"text":"球壳定理与月地检验","id":"球壳定理与月地检验"},{"level":2,"text":"从\"超距\"诘难到惯性质量","id":"从-超距-诘难到惯性质量"},{"level":2,"text":"适用范围与历史地位","id":"适用范围与历史地位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"三大运动定律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/core-contributions/classical-mechanics/three-laws-of-motion"},"next":{"title":"《原理》与天体力学的重建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/core-contributions/classical-mechanics/principia-and-celestial-mechanics"}}